                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Prepare Course Input for Prompt",
                    "returnType": "object",
                    "sourceCode": "let courseTitle = $context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_LEARNING_ITEM.GET_LEARNING_ITEM_DETAILS.$output.items[0].learningItemTitle;\nlet shortDesc = $context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_LEARNING_ITEM.GET_LEARNING_ITEM_DETAILS.$output.items[0].learningItemShortDescription;\nlet syllabus = $context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_LEARNING_ITEM.GET_LEARNING_ITEM_DETAILS.$output.items[0].learningItemDescription;\nlet skills = $context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_LEARNING_ITEM.$currentItem.skills;\nreturn {\"title\":courseTitle,\"desc_short\":shortDesc,\"syllabus\":syllabus,\"skills\":skills};"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1765901231795"
                  },
                  "code": "PREPARE_COURSE_INPUT_FOR_PROMPT",
                  "id": "1765900930552",
                  "inputs": [],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
                  "type": "CODE"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "modelConfiguration": {
                      "modelProperties": {},
                      "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
                      "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
                      "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
                    },
                    "name": "Prompt to get proficiency levels and target outcome"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1765281844690"
                  },
                  "code": "PROMPT_TO_GET_PROFICOENCY_LEVELS_AND_TARGET_OUTCOME",
                  "id": "1765901231795",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1765901231798_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "## Role & Goal\nYou are a meticulous and impartial AI expert assessing the skills a learner would realistically acquire from an educational course. Your goal is to evaluate each target skill based *solely* on provided course details and determine if the claimed proficiency is genuinely attainable and verifiable by a hiring manager.\n\n## Inputs\n* 'proficiency_levels' (JSON): A dictionary defining the skill rating scale.\n {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_RATING_LEVELS.$output.result}}\n* 'course' (JSON): An object containing 'title', 'desc_short', 'syllabus', and a list of 'skills'.\n {{$context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_LEARNING_ITEM.PREPARE_COURSE_INPUT_FOR_PROMPT.$output.result}} \n\n## Core Logic & Instructions\nFor each skill in `course.skills`, perform the following two-step analysis in order:\n\n### 1. Proficiency Assessment\n* **Action:** Select exactly one proficiency level from `proficiency_levels`.\n* **Evidence:** Base your judgment **only** on concrete evidence within `course.desc_short` and `course.syllabus`. Ignore marketing language.\n* **Rule:** If a skill is only mentioned conceptually, peripherally, or as part of a brief introduction, assign a lower plausible rating. Analyze the semantic meaning of the proficiency descriptions, not just the numeric rating.\n\n### 2. Attainability Validation\n* **Action:** Set `outcome_validation` to `true` or `false`.\n* **Default:** The default validation is `false`.\n* **Rule for `true`:** You may only set `outcome_validation: true` if there is **clear and compelling evidence** of all the following:\n    * The skill is a **primary focus** of the course.\n    * Coverage is **deep and extensive**, not just a single module or mention.\n    * There are signs of **practical application** (e.g., projects, labs, case studies).\n\n## Output Constraints\n* **Format:** Your entire output must be a single, strict, valid JSON array. Do not include any text, notes, or markdown outside of the JSON structure.\n* **Schema:** Each object in the array must match the specified schema.\n* **Reasoning:** Justifications must be concise:\n    * `proficiency_reasoning`: Max 40 words. Justify the rating based on *what* from the syllabus is covered.\n    * `validation_reasoning`: Max 30 words. Justify the boolean based on the *depth, focus, and application* of the skill's coverage.\n* **Edge Cases:**\n    * If `course.skills` or `course.syllabus` is missing or empty, return an empty array `[]`.\n    * For skills listed in `course.skills` but not supported by the syllabus, assign the lowest proficiency rating and set `outcome_validation: false`.\n    * Preserve the original ordering of skills from the input.\n\n## Output JSON Schema\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"skill\": \"<skill name>\",\n    \"proficiency_reasoning\": \"<Justification for the chosen proficiency level based on syllabus evidence.>\",\n    \"validation_reasoning\": \"<Justification for the validation outcome based on depth, focus, and application.>\",\n    \"proficiency_rating\": \"<Numeric 'rating' from proficiency_levels>\",\n    \"outcome_validation\": <boolean>\n  }"
                    }
                  ],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"array\",\n  \"items\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"skill\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n      \"proficiency_reasoning\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n      \"validation_reasoning\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n      \"proficiency_rating\": { \"type\": \"integer\" },\n      \"outcome_validation\": { \"type\": \"boolean\" }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n      \"skill\",\n      \"proficiency_reasoning\",\n      \"validation_reasoning\",\n      \"proficiency_rating\",\n      \"outcome_validation\"\n    ]\n  }\n}",
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "businessObjectCode": "ORA_HCM_PROFILEMAN_TALENTPERSONTYPEPROFILESBO",
